math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"x sub 1 comma y sub 1\"></span> and <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"x sub 2 comma y sub 2 \"></span> gives <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"the fraction with numerator 20 minus 18, and denominator 1 minus 0, end fraction, equals, the fraction 2 over 1\"></span>, or 2.</p>\n"}},"createDate":1691007959622,"updateDate":1691007959622,"correct_answer_extracted_from_rationale":true}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1691007959622, 1691007959622),
