>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mn>5</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"x minus 3 equals 2 y plus 7\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mn>3</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mn>7</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>\n<p>The solution to the given system of equations is <math alttext=\"left parenthesis x comma y right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>. What is the value of <math alttext=\"2 x\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math>?</p>","externalid":"4d15e7be-e330-43ce-90bb-537310380c04","templateid":"2cffbf61-0af0-447e-adc2-e81f98037cb0","vaultid":"f1e4caba-8d7a-480c-a542-cfc3fb33eaae","type":"mcq","answerOptions":[{"id":"aff52a11-ddc9-4d82-8c3c-98e98bd7a5d8","content":"<p><math alttext=\"negative 2\"><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"4833bd09-49a0-4bb6-a1d4-c241edfbff8c","content":"<p><math alttext=\"6\"><mn>6</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"39d1877f-d771-44d5-a815-aeccd2d01fb3","content":"<p><math alttext=\"12\"><mn>12</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"4b1874e8-568a-44aa-840f-f668786a38a2","content":"<p><math alttext=\"24\"><mn>24</mn>\n</math></p>"}],"correct_answer":["C"]},"createDate":1691007959817,"updateDate":1691007959817}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1691007959817, 1691007959817),
